attest no_shape_change {
  source yaml(".github/workflows/pr-enforcement.yml")
  reason "Hosts the modeled PullRequestEvidenceWorkflow, JevEnforcementSkill and isolated JevLiveCanary with explicit opt-in variables and separate deterministic results."
